Hi!

I'm the maintainer for the blktrace package in Debian. =20

Over the years, a few patches were added to blktrace package in
Debian.  While some of them are specific to Debian (fixing paths to
Debian conventions, for example), a number of others might be more
generically usable.  I'm including those as attachments.

Please consider applying them in the upstream package.

Greetings,
Bas Zoetekouw.
